      "average_instruments": 14.543620178041543,
      "coverage": 1.0,
      "turnover": 0.3438391564917167,
      "max_abs_library_correlation": null
    },
    "regime_notes": "IC/ICIR remained positive in 2020-2022 (0.04811/0.14286), 2023-2024 (0.05281/0.16212), and 2025-2026 cutoff (0.04869/0.14012). Small cross-asset sample implies conservative uncertainty interpretation."
  },
